  "entry": "code/README.md",
  "notes": "Found in a public repository and run by a computer-use agent (batch public-1). Pan and zoom across whole-slide H&E images, overlay and inspect cell or object layers, mark example cells with SAM or drawing tools, and run spatial statistics (density and hotspots, nearest neighbours, Ripley's L, neighbourhood enrichment, Moran's I, region composition). Each statistic gives a table, a slide overlay and a chart. Data used in the run: synthetic. tree.json is the workflow the agent did and a second agent replayed; run.json says how.",
